<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>World Cup Market Intelligence Dashboard</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --panel: #111827;
      --panel-2: #1f2937;
      --text: #e5e7eb;
      --muted: #9ca3af;
      --border: #374151;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --good: #22c55e;
      --warn: #f59e0b;
      --bad: #ef4444;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 20px 60px;
    }

    .header {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 8px 0 8px;
      font-size: 34px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 820px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .notice {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08);
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: var(--text);
      margin: 18px 0 26px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 20px 0 30px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .card-label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .card-value {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .section {
      margin-top: 28px;
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .section-description {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: -6px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    th, td {
      text-align: left;
      padding: 12px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    th {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      background: var(--panel-2);
    }

    tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .price {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--panel-2);
    }

    .badge-structural {
      border-color: var(--good);
      color: var(--good);
    }

    .badge-tactical {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .badge-speculative {
      border-color: var(--warn);
      color: var(--warn);
    }

    .badge-noise {
      border-color: var(--bad);
      color: var(--bad);
    }

    .two-col {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    ul {
      margin: 8px 0 0 20px;
      padding: 0;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .footer {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 34px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .two-col {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      table {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      th, td {
        padding: 9px 8px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="container">
    <header class="header">
      <div class="eyebrow">World Cup Market Intelligence</div>
      <h1>Prediction Market Dashboard</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        A static dashboard for tracking market-implied probabilities, narratives, liquidity and signal quality around FIFA World Cup 2026.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="notice">
      This dashboard is for research and education only. It is not a betting tip, financial advice or investment advice.
    </div>

    <section class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Provider</div>
        <div class="card-value">{{ provider }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Rows</div>
        <div class="card-value">{{ row_count }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Total Volume</div>
        <div class="card-value">{{ total_volume_display }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">Total Liquidity</div>
        <div class="card-value">{{ total_liquidity_display }}</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Market Structure Snapshot</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Highest implied probabilities from the latest normalized snapshot.
      </p>

      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Market</th>
            <th>Outcome</th>
            <th>Price</th>
            <th>24h Move</th>
            <th>Volume</th>
            <th>Liquidity</th>
            <th>Signal</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for row in rows %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ row.market_display }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.outcome }}</td>
            <td class="price">{{ row.price_display }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.price_change_display }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.volume_display }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.liquidity_display }}</td>
            <td>
              <span class="badge badge-{{ row.signal_class | lower }}">
                {{ row.signal_class }}
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Narrative Map</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Human-entered narrative labels and catalysts. In v0, these are manual analyst notes.
      </p>

      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Outcome</th>
            <th>Narrative</th>
            <th>Catalyst</th>
            <th>Notes</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for row in rows %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ row.outcome }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.narrative }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.catalyst }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.notes }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Interpretation Layer</h2>

      <div class="two-col">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Current strongest market</h3>
          <p>
            <strong>{{ leading_outcome }}</strong> is currently one of the highest-priced outcomes at
            <strong>{{ leading_price }}</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
            In v0, this should be interpreted as a baseline market map, not a confirmed signal.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Liquidity note</h3>
          <p>{{ liquidity_note }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Red-Team Notes</h2>
      <ul>
        {% for note in red_team_notes %}
        <li>{{ note }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Next Research Questions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Which outcomes are priced by reputation rather than current information?</li>
        <li>Where does liquidity appear first once live markets become active?</li>
        <li>Which narratives persist after new data arrives?</li>
        <li>Which signals survive red-team analysis?</li>
        <li>How do prices change after catalysts such as injuries, lineups, match results or news?</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      Generated at {{ generated_at }} from <code>{{ snapshot_path }}</code>.  
      Static dashboard generated by World Cup Market Intelligence v0.2.
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>